From 4042e9b081ac45ead8e956c5c75146815bcbc4a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pavancharak <charak1987@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 14:20:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] chore: release SDKs at version 1.6.2

Bump all four SDK packages to 1.6.2 so they share one version:
@parmana/sdk and parmana (Python) from 1.6.1, and @parmana/connector-sdk
(from 0.3.1) and parmana-connector-sdk (from 0.2.1) to match.

Update the workspace pins on @parmana/connector-sdk, the hardcoded version
string in parmana-connector-sdk, the quickstart line, the regenerated
llms.txt, the lock file, and add a changelog entry.

Signed-off-by: pavancharak <charak1987@gmail.com>
---
