diff --git a/docs/site/changelog.mdx b/docs/site/changelog.mdx
index 69b3a60..77adf5d 100644
--- a/docs/site/changelog.mdx
+++ b/docs/site/changelog.mdx
@@ -10,6 +10,13 @@ product version). The SDKs are versioned independently on their own registries,
 and per-version notes. This page covers changes that affect what you can build against, not
 every commit, run `git log` in the repository for the complete record.
 
+## 2026-10-28
+
+**Changed: SDK versions for the next release**
+
+- `@parmana/sdk` and `parmana` (Python) move to 1.6.2. The TypeScript and Python SDK code is unchanged since 1.6.1: the changes are documentation, formatting and tests.
+- `@parmana/connector-sdk` and `parmana-connector-sdk` (Python) move to 1.6.2, so all four SDK packages share one version. Their previous versions were 0.3.1 and 0.2.1. The TypeScript connector SDK changes its tests and now requires Node.js 24 or later; it declared Node.js 22 before. The Python connector SDK changes only its README and its version string.
+
 ## 2026-10-24
 
 **Changed: the whole repository is licensed under the Apache License 2.0**
diff --git a/docs/site/llms.txt b/docs/site/llms.txt
index 5a1189f..80ef928 100644
--- a/docs/site/llms.txt
+++ b/docs/site/llms.txt
@@ -10,8 +10,8 @@ This file is generated from the documentation navigation. Do not edit it by hand
 * There is no fixed public API base URL. Every deployment has its own, so ask the operator for it.
 * Authentication: every request carries `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. The operator issues the key.
 * On any running server, the machine readable API description is at `/openapi.json`, `/openapi.yaml` and `/api-manifest.json`.
-* TypeScript SDK: `@parmana/sdk` 1.6.1 on npm.
-* Python SDK: `parmana` 1.6.1 on PyPI.
+* TypeScript SDK: `@parmana/sdk` 1.6.2 on npm.
+* Python SDK: `parmana` 1.6.2 on PyPI.
 * If you are an AI agent, start with https://docs.parmanasystems.com/agents/integrate and follow it exactly.
 * For the integration pages concatenated into one document, read https://docs.parmanasystems.com/llms-full.txt.
 
